@startuml
!include style.puml
title Observer: independent event consumers
class EventBus {
  + subscribe(type, listener): Subscription
  + publish(event)
  + close()
}
interface "EventListener<E>" as Listener {
  + onEvent(event)
}
interface Subscription {
  + close()
}
class HudObserver {
  + score()
  + health()
  + result()
}
class EventLogObserver {
  + lines()
}
EventBus o--> Listener : subscription snapshot
EventBus ..> Subscription : returns handle
HudObserver --> Subscription : owns 3
EventLogObserver --> Subscription : owns 6
HudObserver ..> Listener : typed callbacks
EventLogObserver ..> Listener : typed callbacks
note bottom of EventBus
Delivery is synchronous on the simulation thread.
Nested publications follow the current callback batch.
Observers close their own subscription handles.
end note
@enduml
